{"message":"I can help with all three requests, but first I need to verify your identity before accessing or changing your accounts. Please provide your full name and any two of these: date of birth, email address, phone number, or address.

Based on the account information available, the strongest documented personal savings option for your $25,000 is the Gold Account, which earns 5.5% APY when you maintain at least $10,000. A qualifying Green Account (checking) + Gold Account (savings) pairing may add an automatic savings boost. For checking benefits, the Bluest Account offers 2.25% APY on checking, 10 free domestic outgoing wires monthly, a dedicated personal banker, up to $50 in monthly ATM rebates, and no foreign ATM withdrawal fees—but its documented savings pairings are Bronze or Silver, not Gold.

Once verified, I’ll check your Light Blue account’s balance, status, opening date, and pending transactions; confirm whether any early-closure fee applies; then we can select the replacement checking account and savings account. Please also tell me whether you prefer the Green Account + Gold Account combination for the highest documented savings yield, or the Bluest Account for broader checking benefits."}

